            "startSeconds": 491,
            "endSeconds": 629,
            "summary": "Asked the board for support in the new year, urging them to avoid cuts that cause teachers to leave and to instead provide extra support and enrichment programs for teachers and students."
          },
          {
            "name": "Agustina Espino",
            "startSeconds": 649,
            "endSeconds": 754,
            "summary": "Congratulated outgoing President Wells and incoming President Weekly, apologized for any past unintentional disrespect, and expressed her genuine commitment to advocating for children's education and working collaboratively with the board."
          },
          {
